        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml UseCase-MaterialKu\nleft to right direction\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam actorStyle awesome\n\ntitle Use Case Diagram - Sistem MaterialKu\n\nactor \&quot;Admin\\n(ROLE_ADMIN)\&quot;     as Admin\nactor \&quot;Kasir\\n(ROLE_KASIR)\&quot;     as Kasir\nactor \&quot;Gudang\\n(ROLE_GUDANG)\&quot;   as Gudang\nactor \&quot;Manager\\n(ROLE_MANAGER)\&quot; as Manager\n\nrectangle \&quot;Sistem MaterialKu\&quot; {\n  usecase \&quot;Login &amp; Autentikasi\&quot;               as UC_Login\n  usecase \&quot;Kelola Pengguna\&quot;                   as UC_User\n  usecase \&quot;Kelola Material (CRUD)\&quot;            as UC_Material\n  usecase \&quot;Kelola Kategori &amp; Satuan\&quot;          as UC_KatSat\n  usecase \&quot;Input Transaksi\\nPenjualan (POS)\&quot;  as UC_Trx\n  usecase \&quot;Cari / Lihat Material\&quot;             as UC_Cari\n  usecase \&quot;Perbarui Stok\&quot;                     as UC_Stok\n  usecase \&quot;Catat Mutasi Stok\\n(Masuk/Keluar)\&quot; as UC_Mutasi\n  usecase \&quot;Cetak Struk\&quot;                       as UC_Struk\n  usecase \&quot;Lihat Stok\&quot;                        as UC_LihatStok\n  usecase \&quot;Lihat Laporan\&quot;                     as UC_Laporan\n  usecase \&quot;Ekspor Laporan PDF\&quot;                as UC_Export\n  usecase \&quot;Dashboard Analitik\&quot;                as UC_Dashboard\n}\n\n&#39; --- Asosiasi aktor ---\nAdmin   --&gt; UC_User\nAdmin   --&gt; UC_Material\nAdmin   --&gt; UC_KatSat\nAdmin   --&gt; UC_Laporan\n\nKasir   --&gt; UC_Trx\nKasir   --&gt; UC_LihatStok\n\nGudang  --&gt; UC_Mutasi\nGudang  --&gt; UC_LihatStok\n\nManager --&gt; UC_Dashboard\nManager --&gt; UC_Laporan\nManager --&gt; UC_LihatStok\n\n&#39; Login = aktivitas awal sesi (precondition), bukan include\nAdmin   --&gt; UC_Login\nKasir   --&gt; UC_Login\nGudang  --&gt; UC_Login\nManager --&gt; UC_Login\n\n&#39; --- &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt; (langkah wajib) ---\nUC_Trx    ..&gt; UC_Cari : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC_Trx    ..&gt; UC_Stok : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC_Mutasi ..&gt; UC_Stok : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; --- &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt; (langkah opsional) ---\nUC_Struk  ..&gt; UC_Trx     : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\nUC_Export ..&gt; UC_Laporan : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n\nnote bottom of UC_Login\n  Login = prasyarat sesi, bukan &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;.\n  Dilakukan sekali di awal sesi, bukan\n  sub-langkah dari tiap use case.\nend note\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="l8g28xnV2wfxwRXMbVOJ-1">
